## EC-Specific Yellow Gold Settings

Most settings in the 20-ring table above accept multiple stone shapes. These four settings are built specifically for the emerald cut. They have prong placement or bezel profiles designed for the emerald cut's rectangular corners.

[![Classic emerald cut diamond ring in yellow gold solitaire setting](/images/emerald-cut-diamond-yellow-gold-ring-classic.avif)](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings?MetalType=yg&ShapeID=Emerald&a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)

